 dehydration to yield conjugated product. Equipment: Jacketed reactor with mechanical stirring, reflux condenser, thermometer, addition funnel. Workup & Purification: Water removal by azeotropic distillation or vacuum distillation, product crystallization or column chromatography separation. Final purification typically yields >95% pure etocrylene. Industrial Applications: Etocrylene is a key intermediate/active ingredient in UV-absorbing cosmetic formulations (SPF products).",\n      "uncertainty_type": 4\n    }\n  ],\n  "root_node_id": "",\n  "source": "SynthesisCompleter_agent",\n  "uncertainty_type": 4\n}""",\n      \'name\': \'Octocrylene/74268b26/process_route.json\'\n    },\n    id=\'tooluse_GT0PLVB1maHWFE89CNYs8b\',\n    name=\'save_json\'\n  )\n)] role=\'model\'', 'level': 'info', 'logger': 'lciBuilder', 'timestamp': '2026-11-02 14:31:51'}
