g base required - Sodium ethoxide (NaEt) or potassium carbonate (K2CO3) in aprotic solvents, or sodium hydride (NaH). Base: typically 1-2 molar equivalents. Solvent: Polar aprotic solvents essential - Ethanol (if using NaOEt) or DMSO preferred; N,N-Dimethylformamide (DMF) acceptable. Temperature: Room temperature to 60-80°C. Higher temperatures (50-80°C) accelerate reaction significantly. Exothermic reaction requires controlled addition. Reaction Time: 2-24 hours. Equipment: Round-bottom flask with stirring and reflux condenser, addition funnel for controlled alkyl halide addition, inert atmosphere. Product Yield: Typically 60-85% under optimized conditions. Industrial Applications: Used to synthesize methyl ketones and other organic synthons in pharmaceutical and fine chemical manufacturing.",\\n      "source": "SynthesisCompleter_agent",\\n      "uncertainty_type": 4\\n    },\\n    {\\n      "reaction_SMILES": "CCOC(=O)CC#N.O=C(c1ccccc1)c1ccccc1>>CCOC(=O)C(C#N)=C(c1ccccc1)c1ccccc1.O",\\n      "source": "SynthesisCompleter_agent",\\n      "uncertainty_type": 4,\\n      "target_molecule": {\\n        "smiles": {\\n          "value": "CCOC(=O)C(C#N)=C(c1ccccc1)c1ccccc1",\\n          "method": "RDKit",\\n          "source": "pubchem",\\n          "uncertainty_type": 2\\n        },\\n        "name": "Etocrylene",\\n        "chemical_formula": {\\n          "value": "C18H15NO2",\\n          "method": "PubChem lookup",\\n          "source": "pubchem",\\n          "uncertainty_type": 2\\n        },\\n        "molecular_weight": {\\n          "value": 277.3,\\n          "unit": "g/mol",\\n          "method": "PubChem lookup",\\n          "source": "pubchem",\\n          "uncertainty_type": 2\\n        },\\n        "inchi": {\\n          "value": "InChI=1S/C18H15NO2/c1-2-21-18(20)16(13-19)17(14-9-5-3-6-10-14)15-11-7-4-8-12-15/h3-12H,2H2,1H3",\\n          "method": "PubChem lookup",\\n          "source": "pubchem",\\n          "uncertainty_type": 2\\n        },\\n        "iu