{'event': "[Event] Author: orchestrator_agent, Type: Event, Final: False, Content: parts=[Part(\n  function_response=FunctionResponse(\n    id='tooluse_gn59E1mNuF0Ovg6wzo15lX',\n    name='InventoryDrafter_agent',\n    response={\n      'result': {\n        'inventory': {\n          'comment': 'Complete 7-step synthesis route for Octocrylene (2-ethylhexyl 2-cyano-3,3-diphenylprop-2-enoate), a UV filter for cosmetics. Step 1: Knoevenagel condensation (ethyl cyanoacetate + benzophenone → Etocrylene). Step 2: Acetoacetic ester alkylation (ethyl acetoacetate + butyl bromide → ethyl 2-acetylhexanoate). Step 3: Selective ketone reduction (ethyl 2-acetylhexanoate + H2 → ethyl 2-(1-hydroxyethyl)hexanoate). Step 4: Ester hydrolysis (ethyl 2-(1-hydroxyethyl)hexanoate + H2O → 2-(1-hydroxyethyl)hexanoic acid). Step 5: Diol formation (2-(1-hydroxyethyl)hexanoic acid + CH4 → 2-butylbutane-1,3-diol). Step 6: Decarbonylation (2-butylbutane-1,3-diol + CO → 2-ethylhexanol + CO2). Step 7: Transesterification (Etocrylene + 2-ethylhexanol → Octocrylene + ethanol). Normalized to 1 kg Octocrylene reference product.',\n          'name': 'Octocrylene production, GLO',\n          'nodes': [\n            {<... 12 items at Max depth ...>},\n            {<... 12 items at Max depth ...>},\n            {<... 12 items at Max depth ...>},\n            {<... 12 items at Max depth ...>},\n            {<... 12 items at Max depth ...>},\n            <... 9 more items ...>,\n          ],\n          'source': 'InventoryDrafter_agent'\n        },\n        'source': 'InventoryDrafter_agent',\n        'success': 'Inventory format validated.',\n        'uncertainty_type': 4\n      }\n    }\n  )\n)] role='user'", 'level': 'info', 'logger': 'lciBuilder', 'timestamp': '2026-11-02 14:32:47'}
